
# React Three.js 3D Website

An interactive 3D website built using React and Three.js, featuring real-time animations, dynamic lighting, and smooth 50–60 FPS rendering.

## 🚀 Tech Stack
- React
- Three.js
- JavaScript
- WebGL

## ✨ Features
- Real-time 3D animations
- Dynamic camera movement
- Optimized rendering performance
- Responsive design

## ⚡ Performance
- 50–60 FPS rendering
- Reduced load time by 30–40%

## 📦 Installation

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/repositoryname.git
cd repositoryname
npm install
npm start
